  "findings": [
    "Largest reset failure: title and complete message recovered through overlapping ordinary native scroll captures. Message states credentials could not be removed, profile/logs still present, AI connections paused until removal finishes. Retry erasure and Not now remain readable and visible throughout.",
    "Other R43 originals not yet parent-reviewed; no whole matrix visual acceptance. Three mode failures unresolved.",
    "R43 all6 main model keyboard/Done originals reviewed: actual keys, caret, Select all/Done and exact q-prefixed draft visible in normal/dark/largest. Largest model fits fully above keyboard. Done dismisses keys with draft retained. This sourceR37 scope does not resolve separate multi-field mode focus failures.",
    "Largest recovery12 originals reviewed. Reload confirmation fully visible including discard warning/Reload/Keep draft. Pending cleanup/removal retry controls and saved-connection reload are legible. Some long status-message starts/endings remain outside individual viewports; these stills alone are not a full status paragraph capture. Native saved-state checkpoints separately establish restart/retry/stale/discard outcomes.",
    "Largest draft discard confirmation fully readable. Removal confirmation scroll captures recover complete message: removes saved API key and Google tokens from this device; health records stay here. Both Remove and Cancel stay visible. These6 frames close only these confirmation scopes."
  ],
  "acceptance": "scoped reset-alert coverage only"
}
